This Terraform program creates an Elastic Beanstalk application with an application version lifecycle. The application version will be retained for 5 days before being deleted. The program includes the necessary resources such as an IAM role, an S3 bucket, an S3 object, and the Elastic Beanstalk application itself.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

