Here is the corrected Terraform configuration with the AWS provider configured to use environment variables for credentials:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region     = "us-west-2"  # Default region, can be changed as needed
  access_key = var.aws_access_key
  secret_key = var.aws_secret_key
}

