This Terraform program creates an AWS Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) with one public subnet and one private subnet. The public subnet is configured to automatically assign public IP addresses to instances, while the private subnet does not. An internet gateway is attached to the VPC to allow outbound internet access from the public subnet. A NAT gateway is set up in the private subnet to allow instances in the private subnet to access the internet.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
