This Terraform program sets up an AWS S3 bucket to store code build output and an AWS CodeBuild project configured to use this S3 bucket for storing artifacts. The CodeBuild project is set up to use a GitHub repository as its source, with specific environment settings including a small compute type and an Alpine Linux image. Additionally, an IAM role is created to provide the necessary permissions for the CodeBuild project to access the S3 bucket and other AWS services.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

