This Terraform configuration sets up an AWS environment for storing code build outputs using an S3 bucket, along with a VPC, subnet, security group, and a CodeBuild project. The CodeBuild project is configured to use the S3 bucket for artifacts, run in a VPC with restricted internet access, and pull source code from a GitHub repository.

