This Terraform configuration sets up an AWS environment that provisions an EC2 instance and backs it up daily at midnight using AWS Backup. The configuration includes creating an IAM role for AWS Backup, a backup vault, a backup plan, an EC2 instance, and a backup selection for the EC2 instance.

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

# IAM Role for AWS Backup
resource "aws_iam_role" "backup_role" {
  name = "backup_execution_role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
