This Terraform program creates an S3 Glacier vault named "MyArchive" with an associated access policy defined using the `aws_iam_policy_document` data source. The policy allows read-only access to the vault. Additionally, it locks the vault using the `aws_glacier_vault_lock` resource with a specified policy and completion status.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_sns_topic" "glacier_sns_topic" {
  name = "glacier-sns-topic"
}

resource "aws_glacier_vault" "my_archive" {
